idden row due to scroll. Not necessarily.\n\nWait, \"each item's payout is now capped by the catalogue figure for that item.\" Look at the totals: individual values match row prices. Steel appears only in total, not row. If a row is missing, that's a display issue but not cap.\n\nHold on—maybe \"Sell Old Gear\" intentionally excludes helmets in \"old gear\" list? But total includes 218 exactly matching Steel Full Helmet's sell price. Odd. Let me screenshot the sheet."}
