d it broke the bulk sheet? Hmm.\n\nLet me look at the initial partial sheet more carefully: The Slayer Platebody row text was cut off at the bottom by the Total bar. This is a visual defect regardless of expandability. I'll report it. But note \"a quote that was never on screen gets rejected\" — \"Slayer Platebody\" was partially on screen; yes visible (cut). Use observed_quote \"Slayer Platebody\" (the observed element text). Good.\n\nNow, is there maybe another bug in the bulk preview: with toggle OFF, the total includes Steel Helmet but row hidden; with toggle ON, only Bronze Axe and Iron Sword (2 rows) and no clipping. Fine.\n\nBefore filing, let's get fresh element refs:\n- Sell tab Materials list for Copper Ore row.\n- Bulk sheet for Slayer row.\n\nWe'll file copper report using current/latest Sell observe. Let's navigate Shop > Sell > Materials. Currently on Buy list at ores. Tap Sell [1], Materials [14]."}
