m 2,567,890 to 692,890, i.e., 1,875,000 was charged (25% off 2.5M), 25,000 less than the displayed total. Short format rounds the checkout price to one decimal.\n\nSymptom: wrong_value. Steps include exact starting coins (precondition) and observed post-purchase.\n\nWill the developer accept? The question is whether the \"observed_quote\" 1.9M is on the current screen (yes, row still shows 1.9M) but the row isn't a purchase total anymore (ACTIVE). Hmm, the quote 1.9M is on screen. Fine.\n\nLet's file."}
